   "title": "Before the Speeches Begin",
   "turnin": "r20_elf_capital_cook",
   "xp": 195
  },
  {
   "copper": 32,
   "description": "Even death has not persuaded the Debtbound Zombies to abandon their unpaid tolls. Lay six to rest at night in the Lethariel Glades south of Lethariel, before their wandering feet ruin more saplings. Dawn will burn them, but I would sooner grant them peace than leave the matter to the sun.",
   "giver": "r20_elf_capital_envoy",
   "giver_name": "Eriath Boughwarden",
   "giver_settlement": "Lethariel",
   "id": "lethariel_wardens_01",
