   "title": "Bread Does Not Keep Star-Time",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_035_host",
   "xp": 135
  },
  {
   "copper": 26,
   "description": "Someone has decided that walking beneath Lethariel's trees requires a fee, complete with an imitation of our bough-seal. Defeat four Toll Bandits after dark in the Lethariel Glades south of Lethariel; they appear only at night and are few enough to require a patient search. We planted shade for travellers, not a source of revenue for thieves.",
   "giver": "r20_elf_capital_envoy",
   "giver_name": "Eriath Boughwarden",
