   "xp": 210
  },
  {
   "copper": 26,
   "description": "A councillor who overlooked a forged seal spent ten minutes discussing the streaks in my glaze. Bring me two Silver-Tip Fox Tails from Redfang Vixens in the Lethariel Greatwood east of Lethariel by day, and I can replace my brushes. At least the vixens make their objections quickly.",
