   "xp": 300
  },
  {
   "copper": 32,
   "description": "Our foresters know which roots will trip them; it is the teeth between the roots that trouble me. Kill six Redfang Vixens by day in the Lethariel Greatwood east of Lethariel. They attack passing travellers, so tend to your wounds before seeking the next.",
