  {
   "copper": 32,
   "description": "The lord is long dead, his claim forgotten, yet the Tithe Revenants still come to collect. Lay six to rest at night in the Lethariel Greatwood east of Lethariel. They endure more punishment than the Debtbound Zombies, so approach them prepared. Let this be the last service anyone performs in that lord's name.",
