  {
   "copper": 51,
   "description": "Our bough-seal once meant that a tree would be tended; at the Lethariel Poacher Camp northwest from here, it marks trees for the axe. Defeat five Unlicensed Poachers there, then Poacher Bough-Counter Rusk, who records the theft. They keep the camp by day and night; separate the leader from his guards before you face him. Some of those trees shaded the hands that first carved our seal.",
   "giver": "r20_elf_capital_envoy",
   "giver_name": "Eriath Boughwarden",
   "giver_settlement": "Lethariel",
   "id": "lethariel_wardens_03",
