   "xp": 660
  },
  {
   "copper": 19,
   "description": "Rusk's reckoning reaches into the Glassroot Wilds, beyond the comfort of our walls. Report what you have learned to Faeris Rootbinder at Glassroot Gate. Those lands are contested, and the Accord's seal offers little shelter there; finish your training before you set out.",
   "giver": "r20_elf_capital_envoy",
   "giver_name": "Eriath Boughwarden",
