  {
   "copper": 1100,
   "description": "Our healers have patients waiting and no Glass Venom left; I would spare them having to choose who waits longest. Bring me three portions from Glass-Fang Serpents in the Skyglass Rootways, which lie in the north of The Skyglass Canopy, by day. Walk with care among those roots; I would rather not hand the healers another patient.",
   "giver": "r20_elf_capital_envoy",
