   "copper": 1200,
   "description": "I sent a scout to listen to the Skyglass High Canopy, which lies in the heart of The Skyglass Canopy; the Glass-Knuckle Jungle Apes answered with a branch. Defeat six of them there by day so our watchers can return. Listening to the forest requires a little quiet, and preferably an unbroken head.",
