   "copper": 1400,
   "description": "Paymaster Chirr pays his Last-Pay Archers with coin stripped from the dead of both banners at the Skyglass Paymaster Camp north from here. Defeat five of those archers and the paymaster himself. We have watched this forest grow through enough wars; he will not purchase another beneath its branches.",
