   "description": "When the lanterns are lit, Glass-Shadow Panthers begin their hunt in the Skyglass High Canopy. Bring down five there after dark, and I will pay a bounty so our watchers can make their rounds. You may accept the bounty again twenty-five minutes after each turn-in. The forest has time to spare; those walking home tonight do not.",
